      "content": "Staying alive is not a lack of control but a conscious commitment to continue writing that self-authored story before it is finished. This ongoing habit allows us to find meaning in the moment, turning our agency into a daily practice of resisting the urge to give up. By choosing to create value in a godless universe, we prove that free will exists precisely where none was ever written into the laws of physics.",
      "source": "target",
